msgstr "協力確認書の提出を登録"

msgid ""
"The host organization submits it for each site to the municipalities of the "
"site and of the worker's residence (one if they are the same). It has no "
"expiry date. Submit it again when the site's address, the residence or the "
"contact person changes."
msgstr ""
"受入れ機関が事業所ごとに、事業所の所在地と外国人の住居地の市区町村に提出しま"
"す（同じ市区町村なら 1 通）。有効期限はありません。事業所の所在地・住居地・担"
"当者の連絡先が変わったら出し直します。"

msgid "Edit the support contract"
msgstr "支援委託契約の編集"

msgid "Register a support contract"
msgstr "支援委託契約を登録"

msgid ""
"Entrustment of the whole support plan (full entrustment). Periods of the "
"same host organization cannot overlap. When the next contract is registered, "
"the renewal task of the previous contract is completed automatically."
